  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Brand introduction:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Welcome to Crystal + Light Co, where beauty and spirituality intertwine. Our website, <a href=\"http://www.crystalandlightco.com/\" target=\"_new\">www.crystalandlightco.com</a>, is your gateway to a world of mesmerizing crystals and illuminating light treasures. Delve into our carefully curated collection that celebrates the ethereal allure of crystals and the transformative power of light. Discover the perfect balance between earthly elegance and cosmic radiance, as we invite you to embrace the magic and mystique of each handpicked gem and luminary piece. Whether you seek healing, inspiration, or a touch of enchantment, Crystal + Light Co offers an exquisite array of products to elevate your soul and adorn your surroundings. Embrace the extraordinary as you embark on a journey of enlightenment and wonder with us.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; Product description:</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Immerse yourself in the gentle radiance of our Reiki candles. Crafted with love and intention, these candles create an atmosphere of tranquility and healing. Whether you seek serenity after a long day or wish to set the ambiance for a spiritual practice, our Reiki candles are here to elevate your experience.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Enhance your natural beauty and energy with our stunning crystal jewelry pieces. Each design is a masterpiece, blending elegance with the metaphysical properties of crystals.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">our jewellery reflects your inner light and helps you carry positive vibrations wherever you go.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): reiki infused products, organic essential oils.</span><br><br></p>",
